00e1ficos visualmente apelativos que ajudar\u00e3o a analisar os <\/span><span class=\"s2\">dados<\/span><span class=\"s1\"> em quest\u00e3o.<br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Acesso a relat\u00f3rios e an\u00e1lises de <\/span><span class=\"s2\">dados<\/span><span class=\"s1\"> online atrav\u00e9s de tabelas din\u00e2micas.<br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Agendamento e envio autom\u00e1tico de dashboards por e-mail.<br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Possibilidade de integra\u00e7\u00e3o com os dados de um ERP, como o ERP Primavera.<br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><li class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Solu\u00e7\u00e3o de BI que<\/span><span class=\"s1\"> tem incorporados m\u00e9todos de preven\u00e7\u00e3o para garantir seguran\u00e7a e conformidade dos <\/span><span class=\"s2\">dados<\/span><span class=\"s1\">.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22fc4b3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"22fc4b3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2979297 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"2979297\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e3c88e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9e3c88e\" data-e